===== Hardware =====
==== Serial ====

You can use your usual serial levelshifter. Pinout is:

<code>
           [ LCD  ] [UEXT]



[USB]                  TX RX GND
                    o  o  o  o 
[ethernet] [ GPIO ] [UEXT]
</code>


